    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Our immersive simulation programme is revolutionizing the way children aged 8-12 learn crucial skills. Through role play and hands-on practice using museum spaces we created a unique experiential learning experience at TDF MagnifiScience Centre. We taught by-stander CPR, trauma bleed control, and burn management. Now, our 24 Rescue Rangers are fully equipped to make a difference in their communities!",
